      <orth orig="" extent="full" lang="ar">قَبَآءٌ</orth></form> [<hi rend="ital">A kind of tunic, resembling the</hi> <foreign lang="ar">قَفْتَانٌ</foreign>,
<hi rend="ital">generally reaching to the middle of the shank,
divided down the front, and made to overlap
over the chest.</hi> So in the present day. See also
Dozy, Dict. des noms de vêtements, pp. 352–62.]

 </entryFree>
